WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.260
- I just mentioned "City Slickers,"

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:02.880
which is one of my favorite movies.

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:03.780
I know it's a long time ago.

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:04.770
- That's never been mentioned

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.724
on anything I've ever,
like, "City Slickers,"

00:00:06.724 --> 00:00:07.832
very rarely.
- Are you serious?

00:00:07.832 --> 00:00:10.530
- Yeah, it's very rarely
talked about in the oeuvre,

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:11.589
you know what I mean?
(Kelly gasping)

00:00:11.589 --> 00:00:12.422
(Jake chuckling)

00:00:12.422 --> 00:00:13.410
- I thought I was gonna
be that annoying person

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:14.243
that asks you about the film

00:00:14.243 --> 00:00:15.076
you're asked about all the time,

00:00:15.076 --> 00:00:16.320
like, since you're a kid, okay.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:17.970
- I mean kind of.
- And unique, okay.

00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:20.190
- It's a very special movie for me,

00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:21.023
'cause it's-
- Me too,

00:00:21.023 --> 00:00:22.890
I love that movie so much.
- It's amazing, yeah.

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:24.120
- And I just thought it was so crazy.

00:00:24.120 --> 00:00:25.200
So how did you end up doing that movie?

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.370
You were young, right?

00:00:26.370 --> 00:00:28.020
- I was 11...

00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.033
Yeah.
- Oh my gosh.

00:00:29.033 --> 00:00:30.523
- I know, it's the first thing I ever did,

00:00:30.523 --> 00:00:31.500
I was 11-years-old.

00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:34.410
- Your first thing ever
to do was with that cast?

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:35.310
- Yeah.
- [Kelly] Sure.

00:00:35.310 --> 00:00:36.925
- Pretty incredible, I know.
- Okay, okay.

00:00:36.925 --> 00:00:37.758
(audience laughing)
- Well,

00:00:37.758 --> 00:00:38.665
it's weird-
- Life.

00:00:38.665 --> 00:00:39.498
(Jake laughing)

00:00:39.498 --> 00:00:40.620
- It's like wow.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:44.700
- Well, it's weird 'cause
my parents made movies

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:46.140
and, you know, my mother's a writer,

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:48.150
and so there was a night Billy Crystal

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:50.970
was actually at our house.

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:52.140
- What?
- And yeah, yeah.

00:00:52.140 --> 00:00:54.330
And I was 10 or something like that,

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:57.780
and at the end of dinner
everyone was leaving,

00:00:57.780 --> 00:00:59.460
and I was just so
enamored by him, you know,

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:00.570
like, I was like, oh my god, it's-

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:01.403
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:01:01.403 --> 00:01:02.880
- And I just picked up a chair

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:05.385
and I offered it to him as a parting gift.

00:01:05.385 --> 00:01:07.200
(audience laughing)

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:08.760
I was like, here's a party favor.

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:10.020
I like handed him the gift,

00:01:10.020 --> 00:01:12.030
and he thought it was so funny.

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:12.863
- 'Cause it's-

00:01:12.863 --> 00:01:14.970
- And I was just wanting
to give him a chair.

00:01:14.970 --> 00:01:16.723
- Just genuine, like, take this.

00:01:16.723 --> 00:01:17.556
- I just didn't know what,

00:01:17.556 --> 00:01:18.389
you know, when someone's like leaving

00:01:18.389 --> 00:01:19.222
and you just want to give them something

00:01:19.222 --> 00:01:21.390
and you're like, yeah,
just like, just take it

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:22.223
You know what I mean?
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:22.223 --> 00:01:23.056
And that's how I was,

00:01:23.056 --> 00:01:24.494
and he loved it.
- A souvenir of this dinner.

00:01:24.494 --> 00:01:25.327
- (laughing) Basically.

00:01:25.327 --> 00:01:28.024
And he was like, "That kid's
got something special."

00:01:28.024 --> 00:01:29.460
(Kelly laughing)
(crowd laughing)

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:30.750
Little did he know, but yeah.

00:01:30.750 --> 00:01:32.047
- Oh my god, that's amazing.
- He's like,

00:01:32.047 --> 00:01:34.170
"Come audition for this
new movie that I'm doing,

00:01:34.170 --> 00:01:35.550
'cause I need someone to play my son."

00:01:35.550 --> 00:01:37.920
And then I did and then I got the part.

00:01:37.920 --> 00:01:39.620
- [Kelly] That's so cool.
- Yeah.

